error[B0217]: `xs` is declared twice in one scope
  --> check/same_scope_redeclaration.bloom:10:7
   |
 9 |   let { data: xs } = load()
   |               -- first declared here
10 |   let xs = xs ?? []
   |       ^^ a second declaration
   |
help: give the first another name and read it here: `let { data: xsValue } = …` then `let xs = xsValue ?? …`
   = docs: https://github.com/OxyHQ/Bloom/blob/main/docs/bloom-lang-spec.mdx#43-soundness-rules

error[B0217]: `y` is declared twice in one scope
  --> check/same_scope_redeclaration.bloom:20:7
   |
19 |   let y = x + 1
   |       - first declared here
20 |   let y = y * 2
   |       ^ a second declaration
   |
help: give the first another name and read it here: `let { data: yValue } = …` then `let y = yValue ?? …`
